{"channelId":"UCW6omRD6qe9OiHbKfAC7Lww","row":["Now Owned and Operated by Child Health BC (Formerly KidCareCanada)",27100,"For nine months your focus has been on pregnancy and birth.  All of a sudden baby arrives, and you are PARENTS with the full responsibility of caring for a new life. What to do?  After all, babies don't come with a manual. You want to do the \"right thing\", but may not know what that is. Who to trust?  Parenting is a learned skill. It takes time, patience and help from others to become a confident parent.  Our videos support this journey.  Enjoy!\n\nOur videos are designed for parents of infants. However nurturing is needed at every stage of life and the concepts included in these videos can apply to all ages. Our need to feel safe in relationships is lifelong.","","Canada"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCW6omRD6qe9OiHbKfAC7Lww","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCW6omRD6qe9OiHbKfAC7Lww","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:36.143Z","channelId":"UCW6omRD6qe9OiHbKfAC7Lww","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"1ff5500defffbdf94c957ff15900ff4d84394b69b18ce443e938f9f9e324149f","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"1ed8af8640cbd8dcc180d331c2e8781374dd9f9c956f029af2caff7593f9f0ba"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCW6omRD6qe9OiHbKfAC7Lww","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:36.143Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCW6omRD6qe9OiHbKfAC7Lww","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":27100,"raw":"27.1K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCW6omRD6qe9OiHbKfAC7Lww","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:36.143Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup"